<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's WPI up 4.4 percent in 1996.</title>
<headline>Morocco's WPI up 4.4 percent in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Wholesale Price Index (WPI) rose 4.4 percent in 1996 to 361.6 points from 346.3 the year before, Moroccan Statistics Directorate said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said increases in farming and industrial products, up 5.5 percent and 3.7 percent were behind the rise.</p>
